-- 4. Sweeper — The little machine goes round and round, missing the same
-- corner. Brushes, grit, a pigeon following the broom; the sax hums the round.
-- ~40 cycles (~104 s at 92 BPM).

glideBpm 92 16
-- the hoist gives way to the little machine
fadeSilence 12 [2,3,7,8]
d1 $ stack [bootWork, brushWork]
d2 $ stack [sweeperMiss, sweepBrush]
xfadeIn 4 16 compSweep
xfadeIn 6 16 bassSweep

-- grit and a pigeon following the broom
xfadeIn 9 16 $ stack [sweepGrit, pigeon]
xfadeIn 5 24 colourSweep

-- the reed starts to hum the round
xfadeIn 7 24 reedRound
-- one high spark over the fence
xfadeIn 8 32 trumpetSpark
